sers/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":408,"digest":"sha256:f6db3b8f472e0079afd4300c234abc92578ca07c9006651b2dbc48acb4aed9bd","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-15T19:48:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T19:48:07Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ysya/sshelter/releases/download/v1.0.0-9/SSHelter_universal.app.tar.gz.sig"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ysya/sshelter/tarball/v1.0.0-9","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ysya/sshelter/zipball/v1.0.0-9","body":"Host cards support right-click and Shift+F10 actions: connect, edit, copy address, move to a Group, add tags, and delete with confirmation.\n\nSync setup distinguishes active work, resumable setup, and actual failures. Fixes a race that could incorrectly mark account data as needing review. Hosts and Groups continue syncing together through the unified Library.\n\nWorkspace polish: content-sized dropdown/context menus, bounded long Select options, a resizable Connection details pane with remembered width and keyboard controls, and compact layouts that preserve readability at larger text sizes. Light and dark themes now share neutral gray surfaces with restrained blue accents. Native and Radix scrollbars use transparent tracks and rounded thumbs, with hover/drag feedback and system high-contrast fallback.\n\nValidation: 1,056 frontend tests, production frontend build, safe Rust tests and cross-platform CI. Real-device installation, Windows native popup rendering, and sync between your own devices remain manual acceptance checks.\n"}